      "options": { "content": "Enter one or more KB identifiers in the **Required KB baseline** filter, for example `KB5030219,KB5030310`. Compliance is evaluated from installed inventory in `ConfigurationData`: a computer is **Compliant** when every required KB is installed and **Noncompliant** when one or more are missing. Azure Update Manager assessment data (`patchassessmentresources`) is not evaluated here, so applicability is not considered and a KB that does not apply to a machine still counts as missing. Use the **Computer contains** filter to scope machines and the **Compliance state** filter to slice the details table.", "mode": "markdown" },
      "title": "",
      "type": "text"
